# Public origin people reach the platform at — used for links inside WhatsApp
# messages (session join links). Production: https://<your domain>. Development
# through a tunnel: the https ngrok origin. Origin only, no path. Falls back to
# NEXTAUTH_URL when empty; with neither set, messages carry no link.
